    "How gradually the distortion ramps in and out. Low values snap, high values glide." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Edit / Export tooltip for the nitro effect's smoothness parameter",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
