    "How much bar movement is averaged over time. High values glide, 0 reacts instantly and jitters." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Edit / Export tooltip for the audiobars effect's smoothing parameter",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
